cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "BPL-v1.0: Business Process Logic Benchmark for LLM Agents"
message: If you use this benchmark, please cite it using these metadata.
type: software
abstract: >-
  BPL-v1.0 scores tool-using agents on business rules that apply across a long
  session inside a simulated company. The user message is trusted. Tools on the
  violating path are in-schema. Oracles are SQL queries on a SQLite company.
authors:
